# libretranslate
msgid "**CSP** allows ``unsafe-inline``/``unsafe-eval`` for ``script-src-elem`` and ``blob:`` workers/images, required by Penpot’s SPA and worker-based renderer."
msgstr "**CSP** permet ``unsafe-inline``/``unsafe-eval`` per ``script-src-elem`` i ``blob:`` Treballadors/images, requerits per Penpot gzens SPA i renderitzador basat en treballadors."

