# libretranslate
msgid "**Inventory folders.** [init.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/init.py) calls [build_dev_inventory_matrix](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/inventory/builder.py), which creates one folder per round at `<inventory-dir>-<round>` (or just `<inventory-dir>` when there is a single round). For each folder, `build_dev_inventory` resolves the round's per-app variant payload and bakes it into the inventory's `host_vars` as `applications.<app>: <variant-payload>` overrides. The inventory is therefore variant-resolved on disk; no runtime selector is needed."
msgstr "**Carpetes inventoriàries.** [init.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/init.py) Trucades [build_dev_inventory_matrix](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/inventory/builder.py), que crea una carpeta per ronda a `<inventory-dir>-<round>` (o simplement `<inventory-dir>` quan hi ha una sola ronda). Per cada carpeta, `build_dev_inventory` Resol la càrrega de la variant per al voltant i la fa servir al inventari `host_vars` com a `applications.<app>: <variant-payload>` anul·la. L'inventari es necessita per tant variant-resolved al disc; no cal selector d' execució."

