# libretranslate
msgid "**Traefik migration / edge HA.** v1 keeps openresty as the swarm edge (pinned to manager) to preserve the `sys-front-inj-*` Lua body-rewriting pipeline unchanged. Migrating to Traefik for true multi-replica edge HA is a follow-up requirement and is gated on porting the body_filter.lua injection logic (CSP-meta stripping + head/body snippet injection for Matomo / CSS / JavaScript / Dashboard / Logout) to a Traefik Yaegi plugin OR introducing a Traefik → openresty chain. Without one of those, switching the edge to Traefik would silently drop the frontend-injection pipeline."
msgstr "**Migració Traefik / vora HA.** v1 manté oberta com la vora dels eixams (S' ha preparat per al gestor) per preservar la `sys-front-inj-*` La canonada d'escriptura del cos no ha canviat. L'enhorabona a Traefik per la veritable vora multi-replica HA és un requisit de seguiment i porta a port el body_filter.lua Injecciona lògica (Botiga de retalls CSP-meta desposseint + cap/ cos per Matomo / CSS / JavaScript / Dashboard / Surt) per a un connector Traefik Yaegi o bé presentar una cadena d' obertura de Traefik. Sense un d'ells, canviar la vora a Traefik deixaria en silenci la canonada frontal d'injecció."

