msgid "**Trusted-Header SSO Bridge:**"
msgstr "**Pont SSO de confiança:**"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Trusted-Header SSO Bridge:**   When the oauth2-proxy SSO flavor is active, Snipe-IT's native `loginViaRemoteUser()` is enabled via the `Setting` model (`login_remote_user_enabled`, `login_remote_user_header_name = HTTP_X_FORWARDED_PREFERRED_USERNAME`). nginx gates `/login` through oauth2-proxy/Keycloak and injects the verified `X-Forwarded-Preferred-Username` header, which Snipe-IT matches against `users.username` (the user must pre-exist and be activated — sync them via LDAP) to mint a native `snipeit_session`. Visitors without a matching activated user silently fall through to the normal login form (no error). The password/LDAP login form stays available as a fallback (`login_common_disabled = 0`), and the in-app logout is redirected to the central OIDC end-session URL."
msgstr "**Pont SSO de confiança:** Quan l' oauth2- El sabor de la SSO és actiu, és natiu de Snipe-IT `loginViaRemoteUser()` està habilitat a través de la `Setting` model (`login_remote_user_enabled`, `login_remote_user_header_name = HTTP_X_FORWARDED_PREFERRED_USERNAME`)portes . nginx `/login` a través de oauth2- proxy/Keycloak i injecta el verificat `X-Forwarded-Preferred-Username` capçalera, que coincideix amb Snipe-IT `users.username` (L' usuari ha de pre-exist i ser activat sincronitzeu- lo mitjançant LDAP) per mintar un nadiu `snipeit_session`. Visiteu- los sense que un usuari s' activi en silenci a través del formulari d' accés normal (cap error). El formulari d' accés per contrasenya/LDAP es manté disponible com a alternativa (`login_common_disabled = 0`), i la sortida d' entrada s' ha redireccionat a l' URL de la sessió final d' OIDC central."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Trusted-header SSO bridge:** Establishes the owner session from the oauth2-proxy identity (see below)."
msgstr "**Pont SSO de confiança:** Estableix la sessió del propietari de la oauth2- La identitat del proxy (Veure a sota)."

