# libretranslate
msgid "**Your tools reachable from your assistants.** About twenty applications now speak MCP. Gitea, GitLab, Mattermost, Nextcloud, n8n, Baserow, Jenkins, Home Assistant, Moodle, Snipe-IT and WordPress serve their own endpoints; ten more get one through a locked-down sidecar. Open WebUI, Flowise and the agents discover what the deployment offers and register it automatically. Access is bounded rather than assumed: blocked paths are declared, every served path is gated, tools a provider calls mutating are withheld, reader and writer roles are separate, and each provider authenticates callers as its own service account. See [svc-ai-mcp-adapter](roles/svc-ai-mcp-adapter/README.md)."
msgstr "**Les vostres eines poden arribar als vostres ajudants.** Unes vint aplicacions ara parlen MC. - Gitate. GitLab, Mattermost, Nextcloud, n8n. Baserow, Jenkins, Home Assistant, Moodle, Snipe-IT i WordPress Serveix els seus propis punts finals, deu més aconseguir un a través d'un port bloquejat. Open WebUI, Flowise I els agents descobriran què ofereix el desplegament i registrar-lo automàticament. L' accés està prohibit en lloc d'assumir: s' han declarat camins bloquejats, cada camí ser portada, eines que un proveïdor anomena el mutat estan ocultats, lectors i rols d'escriptors estan separats, i cada proveïdors cridades com a propi compte de servei. Veure [svc-ai-mcp-adapter](roles/svc-ai-mcp-adapter/README.md)."

