msgid "A workflow with a `workflow_dispatch` trigger MUST keep its `name:` at or below 25 characters, enforced by [test_workflow_dispatch_name_length.py](../../../../../tests/lint/repository/test_workflow_dispatch_name_length.py). The dispatch menu lists those names in one narrow column, where a longer one is truncated. Move the explanatory wording into `run-name:`, which carries no such limit."
msgstr "Un flux de treball amb un `workflow_dispatch` Activar MUST mantenir-la `name:` at o a sota 25 Caràcters, forçats per [test_workflow_dispatch_name_length.py](../../../../../tests/lint/repository/test_workflow_dispatch_name_length.py). El menú d' enviament llista aquests noms en una columna estreta, on s' ha truncat una més llarga. Mou el mot explicatiu cap a `run-name:`, que no porta aquest límit."

