# libretranslate
msgid "Client to adapter: ``credentials.mcp_bearer``, owned by ``mcp-web-app-baserow``. The adapter refuses any request that does not present it, so a caller on the container network is no longer implicitly trusted."
msgstr "Client per adaptar- se: ``credentials.mcp_bearer``, propietat de ``mcp-web-app-baserow``. L' adaptador refusa qualsevol petició que no l' hi presenti, de manera que una crida a la xarxa contenidora no és fiable implícitament."

# libretranslate
msgid "Client to adapter: `credentials.mcp_bearer`, owned by `mcp-web-app-baserow`. The adapter refuses any request that does not present it, so a caller on the container network is no longer implicitly trusted."
