msgstr "Funció Comment"

# libretranslate
msgid "Client-side configuration bind-mounted into the `infinito` runner so that pip, npm, and apt route through the Sonatype Nexus 3 OSS pull-through proxy."
msgstr "Configuració de la banda clienta en la que es connecta `infinito` executat per tal que aquest pip, npm, i una ruta apt a través del Sonatype Nexus 3 L'ATS ha de ser un servidor intermediari."

# libretranslate
msgid "Clients do not read the server list directly. [`lookup('mcp_servers')`](../../../../../plugins/lookup/mcp_servers.py) computes the intersection of the provider's admitted clients, resolved by `derive_allowed_consumers` in [`utils/roles/applications/mcp.py`](../../../../../utils/roles/applications/mcp.py), with the calling client's `supported_transports` and `supported_auths`, resolves each provider's declared credential, and returns:"
msgstr "Els clients no llegeixen directament la llista de servidors. [`lookup('mcp_servers')`](../../../../../plugins/lookup/mcp_servers.py) Calcula la intersecció dels clients admèss del proveïdor, resolts per `derive_allowed_consumers` in [`utils/roles/applications/mcp.py`](../../../../../utils/roles/applications/mcp.py), amb el client de trucades `supported_transports` i `supported_auths`, resoldre cada proveïdor ha declarat credential, i retorna:"

# libretranslate
msgid "Clients present a Gitea personal access token as `Authorization: Bearer <token>`. The token is issued against the administrator account and kept in `sys-token-store`. Its `auth_subject` is `administrator`, so MCP calls run with administrator rights rather than as the requesting user."
msgstr "Els clients presenten un Gitea Testimoni d' accés personal com a `Authorization: Bearer <token>`. El testimoni s' envia contra el compte d' administrador i es manté en `sys-token-store`. És `auth_subject` és `administrator`, per tant MCP crida a l' execució amb drets d' administrador en comptes de sol·licitar l' usuari."

# libretranslate
msgid "Clients present a Gitea personal access token as ``Authorization: Bearer <token>``. The token is issued against the administrator account and kept in ``sys-token-store``. Its ``auth_subject`` is ``administrator``, so MCP calls run with administrator rights rather than as the requesting user."
msgstr "Els clients presenten un Gitea Testimoni d' accés personal com a ``Authorization: Bearer <token>``. El testimoni s' envia contra el compte d' administrador i es manté en ``sys-token-store``. És ``auth_subject`` és ``administrator``, per tant MCP crida a l' execució amb drets d' administrador en comptes de sol·licitar l' usuari."

# libretranslate
msgid "Clients present a long-lived access token as `Authorization: Bearer <token>`. The token is minted once per deployment and kept in `sys-token-store` under the `administrator` user, not in the role's `credentials:` block. An unauthenticated request is answered with 404: Home Assistant does not reveal the endpoint."
msgstr "Els clients presenten una fitxa d' accés a llarg termini com `Authorization: Bearer <token>`. La fitxa es mineja una vegada per desplegament i manté en `sys-token-store` Sota la `administrator` usuari, no en el paper `credentials:` bloquejar. S' ha respost una petició sense autenticar 404: L' assistent d' inici no revela el punt d' acabament."

# libretranslate
msgid "Clients present a long-lived access token as ``Authorization: Bearer <token>``. The token is minted once per deployment and kept in ``sys-token-store`` under the ``administrator`` user, not in the role’s ``credentials:`` block. An unauthenticated request is answered with 404: Home Assistant does not reveal the endpoint."
msgstr "Els clients presenten una fitxa d' accés a llarg termini com ``Authorization: Bearer <token>``. La fitxa es mineja una vegada per desplegament i manté en ``sys-token-store`` Sota la ``administrator`` usuari, no en el paper d' UIDs ``credentials:`` bloquejar. S' ha respost una petició sense autenticar 404: L' assistent d' inici no revela el punt d' acabament."

