msgid "If any `make swarm-*` target aborts at **Set up job** with `mkdirat var/run...` on a recent Docker engine, point act at a fixed runner image per [Workflow Loop](workflow.md#act-fails-at-set-up-job-on-recent-docker)."
msgstr "Si n'hi ha cap `make swarm-*` objectiu aborten **Estableix el treball** amb `mkdirat var/run...` en un motor de Dockers recent, actua en una imatge de llançador fixName [Bucle de feina](workflow.md#act-fails-at-set-up-job-on-recent-docker)."

# libretranslate
msgid "If any precondition fails, you MUST return to [Compose Loop](compose.md) and re-establish the baseline before continuing."
msgstr "Si falla alguna condició, has de tornar a [Compensa el bucle](compose.md) i reinicia el punt de partida abans de continuar."

# libretranslate
msgid "If automation logic is not shell-based, it MUST live outside `scripts/` and be called from a `.sh` wrapper when needed."
msgstr "Si la lògica de l' autocompleció no està basada en l' intèrpret d' ordres, ha de viure fora `scripts/` i ser cridat d'un `.sh` embolcalla quan calia."

# libretranslate
msgid "If container or security setup behaves differently than on Linux, the WSL2 guide covers the usual [Docker Buildx](https://docs.docker.com/reference/cli/docker/buildx/), [DNS](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Domain_Name_System), and [AppArmor](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/AppArmor)-related workarounds."
msgstr "Si el contenidor o l' arranjament de seguretat es comporta diferent a Linux, el WSL2 La guia cobreix el costum [CockerConx](https://docs.docker.com/reference/cli/docker/buildx/), [DNS](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Domain_Name_System), i [AppArmor](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/AppArmor)- D'acord."

# libretranslate
msgid "If disk space is tight, you SHOULD move Docker data, caches, and your working directory to the SSD."
msgstr "Si l'espai del disc és ajustat, has de moure dades amarrada, cau, i el directori de treball a la SSD."

# libretranslate
