# libretranslate
msgid "Inside a play the process boundary is the task: Ansible forks a fresh worker per task, so `_MERGED_APPLICATIONS_CACHE` starts empty in every worker. `get_merged_applications` therefore also accepts the play-scoped carrier fact `_INFINITO_APPLICATIONS_RENDERED` (payload plus cache key, parked once by the constructor stage) and serves it when the key matches. See [applications.md](../../docs/contributing/artefact/files/plugins/lookup/applications.md) for the contract."
msgstr "Dins d' un joc el límit del procés és la tasca: Ansible forca un nou treballador per tasca, així que `_MERGED_APPLICATIONS_CACHE` Comença buit en cada treballador. `get_merged_applications` Per tant, també accepta el fet de la porta de joc `_INFINITO_APPLICATIONS_RENDERED` (Carregador més clau de la memòria cau, aparcat una vegada per l'escenari constructora) i serveix-ho quan la clau coincideixi. Veure [applications.md](../../docs/contributing/artefact/files/plugins/lookup/applications.md) pel contracte."

