# libretranslate
msgid "On Windows, use [WSL2](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/wsl/about) as the development environment and run the repository commands inside WSL2, not directly in [PowerShell](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/powershell/). Use Ubuntu 24.04 with [Docker Desktop WSL2 integration](https://docs.docker.com/desktop/features/wsl/), enable [`systemd`](https://systemd.io/), and expect a few Windows-specific follow-up steps around [certificate authority (CA)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Certificate_authority) trust and local name resolution."
msgstr "En Windows, useu [WSLLanguage2](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/wsl/about) Com a entorn de desenvolupament i executa les ordres del repositori dins del WSL2, no directament in [PowerShell](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/powershell/). Useu Ubuntu 24.04 amb [Amarrador d' escriptori WSL2 Integració](https://docs.docker.com/desktop/features/wsl/), habilita [`systemd`](https://systemd.io/), i espereu algunes passes específiques de seguiment de Windows [autoritat de certificació (CA)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Certificate_authority) Resolució de noms i locals."

