# libretranslate
msgid "Single SPOT for turning `networks.local.subnet` into an address matcher. A swarm task carries an address on every network it joins, all of them site-local, so a service that must bind to one of them needs this rather than a generic \"site-local\" selector."
msgstr "ARPOT per girar `networks.local.subnet` a una partida d' adreces. Una tasca eixam comporta una adreça a cada xarxa que s'uneix, totes les locals del lloc web, per tant un servei que ha de vincular a un d' ells necessita això en comptes d' un genèric \"site-local\" selector."

