msgid "Single point of truth for the repo-root anchor, replacing the repeated ``[playbook_dir, '<rel>'] | path_join`` boilerplate at cross-role include/template/script/src call sites. Joins every term, so a path may be passed whole ('roles/x/y.yml') or split across terms when a segment is a variable (``lookup('path_absolute', 'roles', system_service_role_name)``)."
msgstr "Un únic punt de veritat per a l'àncora repo-root, substituint la repetició ``[playbook_dir, '<rel>'] | path_join`` caldera a la creuada include/template/script/src llocs de trucades. Uneix cada terme, de manera que es pugui passar un camí sencer ('roles/x/y.yml') o dividit per termes quan un segment és una variable (``lookup('path_absolute', 'roles', system_service_role_name)``)."

