# libretranslate
msgid "Snipe-IT is entered through a trusted-header bridge: the oauth2-proxy authenticates against Keycloak and Snipe-IT's `loginViaRemoteUser()` mints a native session for the matching `users.username` row (see [`files/php/apply/sso_config.php`](./files/php/apply/sso_config.php)). The gate declares no `allowed_groups`, so `biber` passes the proxy — but the role provisions only the administrator account ([`tasks/03_admin.yml`](./tasks/03_admin.yml)), so the header carries a username Snipe-IT does not know and the visitor falls back to the native login form. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) therefore declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`, while the `administrator` persona stays live (`PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=false`) and exercises the full bridge end to end."
msgstr "Snipe-IT s' introdueix a través d' un pont de cap de confiança: la oauth2- Cal autenticar- se contra l'Ar proxy Keycloak i Snipe-IT `loginViaRemoteUser()` mints una sessió nativa per a la coincidència `users.username` Fila (Veure [`files/php/apply/sso_config.php`](./files/php/apply/sso_config.php))La porta declara que no. `allowed_groups`, i `biber` Passa l' intermediari KDEDIRS però les disposicions de rol només són el compte d' administrador ([`tasks/03_admin.yml`](./tasks/03_admin.yml))La capçalera té un nom d' usuari Snite-IT no coneix i el visitant torna al formulari d' accés natiu. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) Per tant, declara `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`, mentre la `administrator` persona es queda en viu (`PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=false`) I exerceix el pont sencer per acabar."

# libretranslate
msgid "Snipe-IT is entered through a trusted-header bridge: the oauth2-proxy authenticates against Keycloak and Snipe-IT’s ``loginViaRemoteUser()`` mints a native session for the matching ``users.username`` row (see ```files/php/apply/sso_config.php`` <./files/php/apply/sso_config.php>`__). The gate declares no ``allowed_groups``, so ``biber`` passes the proxy — but the role provisions only the administrator account (```tasks/03_admin.yml`` <./tasks/03_admin.yml>`__), so the header carries a username Snipe-IT does not know and the visitor falls back to the native login form. ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ therefore declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true``, while the ``administrator`` persona stays live (``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=false``) and exercises the full bridge end to end."
msgstr "Snipe-IT s' introdueix a través d' un pont de cap de confiança: la oauth2- Cal autenticar- se contra l'Ar proxy Keycloak i Snipe-ITns ``loginViaRemoteUser()`` mints una sessió nativa per a la coincidència ``users.username`` Fila (Veure ```files/php/apply/sso_config.php`` <./files/php/apply/sso_config.php>`__). The gate declares no ``allowed_groups``, so ``biber`` passes the proxy — but the role provisions only the administrator account (```tasks/03_admin.yml`` <./tasks/03_admin.yml>`__), so the header carries a username Snipe-IT does not know and the visitor falls back to the native login form. ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ therefore declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true``, while the ``administrator`` persona stays live (``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=false``) I exerceix el pont sencer per acabar."

# libretranslate
msgid "Snipe‑IT is an open‑source asset management system designed to streamline hardware and software inventory tracking. This deployment provides an automated, containerized solution using Docker Compose, centralized MariaDB database integration, and secure, configurable environment settings, including robust SMTP email support and pending SAML authentication enhancements."
msgstr "SnipeIT és un sistema de gestió d'actius del codi font obert dissenyat per al maquinari de la xarxa i el seguiment de l'inventari de programari. Aquest desplegament proporciona una solució automatitzada, que usa el recipient Docker ComposeDescentralitzat MariaDB Integració de la base de dades, i l' arranjament d' entorn configurable, incloent la robusta implementació de correu SMTP i les millores d' autenticació SAL."

# libretranslate
msgid "So `meta/services.yml` MUST NOT have a top-level `services:` key wrapping its content. `meta/volumes.yml` MUST NOT have a top-level `volumes:` key, and the same rule applies to `meta/server.yml`, `meta/rbac.yml`, `meta/users.yml`, and `meta/info.yml`. The filename alone fixes the path prefix in the materialised application tree, which keeps consumer paths short and predictable (no redundant `compose.…` prefixes)."
msgstr "Així que `meta/services.yml` No té nivell superior `services:` Ajusteu la tecla el contingut. `meta/volumes.yml` No té nivell superior `volumes:` clau, i la mateixa regla s' aplica a `meta/server.yml`, `meta/rbac.yml`, `meta/users.yml`, i `meta/info.yml`. El nom de fitxer tot sol soluciona el prefix del camí a l' arbre d' aplicacions materialitzades, que manté camins de consum curts i previsibles (no redundant `compose.…` Prefixos)."

# libretranslate
msgid "So a conditional `\"{{ 'web-app-matomo' in group_names }}\"` edge pulls its provider into the static closure regardless of whether `web-app-matomo` is actually selected. The closure is the co-deploy superset."
msgstr "Així que un condicional `\"{{ 'web-app-matomo' in group_names }}\"` La vora posa el seu proveïdor al tancament estàtic independentment de si `web-app-matomo` De fet, està seleccionat. El tancament és el superset co-deploy."

# libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "So the format is read from the workflow itself. Every input renders as one segment, ``<head><value> ``, where the head is the emoji the workflow's own ``format('🐧{0} ', …)`` prefixes the value with. An input holding its default renders no segment at all, so a title carries only what deviates — and an absent input means \"the workflow's default\", which is exactly what a retrigger should leave alone."
msgstr "El format es llegeix des del flux de treball en si mateix. Cada entrada representa com un segment, ``<head><value> ``, on el cap és el emoji el propi flux de treball ``format('🐧{0} ', …)`` Prefixos amb el valor. Una entrada que manté el seu segment per omissió no representa cap segment, de manera que un títol només porta el que desvia i una entrada absent vol dir \"el flux de treball per omissió\", que és exactament el que un gallet hauria de deixar en pau."

