# libretranslate
msgid "Taiga redirects `/` to the public `/discover` showcase, which renders a bare Login link but not the OIDC entry point; only `/login` binds the SSO directive (see the note in [`files/playwright/_shared.js`](./files/playwright/_shared.js)). The shared personas always enter at the site root, so they can never reach Taiga's SSO button. Taiga's AngularJS shell additionally exposes logout only through `ng-click` / `tg-nav` / `ui-sref` directives, which the generic in-app logout helper cannot activate. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) therefore declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`; the equivalent journeys are driven by the role-local `test-login-oidc.js` and `test-login-native.js` specs, which enter at `/login` and log out through Taiga's own control."
msgstr "Redirigeix `/` a la gent `/discover` Mostra el cas, el qual mostra un enllaç d' accés nus però no el punt d' entrada OIDC; només `/login` uneix la directiva SSO (Veure la nota a [`files/playwright/_shared.js`](./files/playwright/_shared.js)). La persona compartida sempre entra a l'arrel del lloc, així que mai arribarà TaigaEl botó SSO. L' intèrpret d'ordres angulars de Taiga només s'exposa addicionalment a la sortida `ng-click` / `tg-nav` / `ui-sref` Les directives, que l' ajuda genèrica d' una sortida no pot activar. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) Per tant, declara `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` i `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`; els viatges equivalents són conduïts per l'local del rol `test-login-oidc.js` i `test-login-native.js` Especificacions, que entren a `/login` i desconnecteu a través TaigaEl propi control."

