# libretranslate
msgid "The full CSP test surface lives in the same module: `assertCspResponseHeader(response, label)` (returns the parsed directive map), `assertCspMetaParity(page, headerDirectives, label)` (verifies the optional `<meta http-equiv>` echo is a subset of the response header), `installCspViolationObserver(page)` + `readCspViolations(page)` (DOM-side `securitypolicyviolation` capture), `expectNoCspViolations(page, diagnostics, label)` (asserts neither the DOM stream nor `diagnostics.cspRelated` carries a violation), and the `EXPECTED_CSP_DIRECTIVES` constant. Specs MUST require these from `./personas`; inline copies are forbidden and caught at review."
msgstr "Les vides de la superfície de prova completa del mateix mòdul: `assertCspResponseHeader(response, label)` (retorna el mapa de la directiva analitzat), `assertCspMetaParity(page, headerDirectives, label)` (verifica l' opcional `<meta http-equiv>` L' eco és un subconjunt de la capçalera de resposta), `installCspViolationObserver(page)` + `readCspViolations(page)` (El costat DOM `securitypolicyviolation` Captura), `expectNoCspViolations(page, diagnostics, label)` (afirma ni el flux DOM ni `diagnostics.cspRelated` implica una violació), i la `EXPECTED_CSP_DIRECTIVES` Constant. Les Specs MUSA necessiten açò de `./personas`; les còpies inserides estan prohibides i atrapades en revisió."

