msgstr "La lògica del generador tornable viu `utils/domains/list.py`"

# libretranslate
msgid "The reverse closure is fail-safe: any seed that is not modellable in the resolver (no `application_id` and not referenced by any role's `run_after`) MUST trigger a fall-back to a full deploy, as MUST any resolver runtime error. The closure MUST NOT silently shrink the deploy matrix on partial information. The variant narrowing follows the same rule: a role reached only through a `run_after` edge (which the round closure does not follow) keeps every variant, and so does a seed role itself, whose own files changed."
msgstr "El tancament inversa no és segur: qualsevol llavor que no sigui agradable en el sistema de resolució (no `application_id` i no referenciat per cap paper `run_after`) MUST activa una caiguda a un conjunt complet, com a MUST qualsevol error d' execució de resolució. El tancament No s'encongeix silenciosament la matriu expandida en informació parcial. La variant estrenyent segueix la mateixa regla: un paper va assolir només a través d' un `run_after` Vora (el tancament rodó no segueix) Manté cada variant, i també un paper de sembrat si mateix, els seus propis fitxers han canviat."

# libretranslate
msgid "The reverse closure is implemented in [affected resolver](../../../../cli/meta/roles/applications/resolution/affected/__main__.py) and invoked from [affected_roles.sh](../../../../scripts/meta/resolve/diff/affected_roles.sh). The workflow glue lives in [effective_whitelist.sh](../../../../scripts/github/resolve/effective_whitelist.sh)."
msgstr "El tancament inversa està implementat en [Reductor de resolució afectat](../../../../cli/meta/roles/applications/resolution/affected/__main__.py) i invocat des de [affected_roles.sh](../../../../scripts/meta/resolve/diff/affected_roles.sh). El flux de treball on viu cola [effective_whitelist.sh](../../../../scripts/github/resolve/effective_whitelist.sh)."

