# libretranslate
msgid "They travel as `INFINITO_API_OPENAI_KEY`, `INFINITO_API_ANTHROPIC_KEY` and `INFINITO_API_OPENROUTER_KEY` through the workflow `env:` block, the passthrough allowlist in [passthrough.py](../../../../../utils/env/handlers/passthrough.py), the `infinito` service environment in [compose.yml](../../../../../compose.yml), and land in `API.<provider>.api_key` in the development inventory, whose path is the SPOT behind `INFINITO_INVENTORY_VARS_FILE`. Skipping the compose forwarding makes them resolve to empty inside the container without any error."
msgstr "Viatgen com a `INFINITO_API_OPENAI_KEY`, `INFINITO_API_ANTHROPIC_KEY` i `INFINITO_API_OPENROUTER_KEY` a través del flux de treball `env:` bloc, la llista de la llista desplegable passada [passthrough.py](../../../../../utils/env/handlers/passthrough.py), the `infinito` Entorn de servei a [compose.yml](../../../../../compose.yml), i aterrar en `API.<provider>.api_key` A l'inventari de desenvolupament, el camí del SPOT és darrere de `INFINITO_INVENTORY_VARS_FILE`. Saltant el reenviament els fa resoldre buits dins del contenidor sense cap error."

