# libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role runs Memcached as a central engine dependency, mirroring the central-database pattern (``svc-db-postgres``). A consumer reaches it either embedded (a sidecar inside its own stack, ``shared: false``) or from this central pinned stack (``shared: true``)."
msgstr "Aquest paper impossible funciona Memcached com a dependència del motor central, reflectint el patró de base de dades central (``svc-db-postgres``). Un consumidor el porta encastat (Un port a la seva pròpia pila. ``shared: false``) o des d' aquesta pila quedada central (``shared: true``)."

