# libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Hermes Agent in gateway mode as a Docker service, published behind the reverse proxy on its own subdomain, with its compose service pinned to the isolating runtime that the Kata & gVisor role selects for the host. The API server is protected by a generated bearer key, and when the LiteLLM Gateway is part of the deployment the agent's model endpoint is pointed at that gateway with a per-consumer virtual key. Agent state lives in a named volume that the Backup Docker Volumes service captures when it is enabled."
msgstr "Aquest rol col·loca Hermes Agent En mode portal com a servei Docker, publicat al darrera de l' intermediari invers en el seu propi subdomini, amb el seu servei compondre a l' hora d' execució iteratiu que el Kata & gVisor Funció per a la màquina. La API El servidor està protegit per una clau generada per ós, i quan la LiteLLM Gateway forma part del punt final del model de l'agent s'apunta amb una clau virtual pertinent. L' estat de l' agent viu en un volum anomenat que el Backup Docker Volumes Captura de servei quan està habilitat."

msgid "This role deploys Hermes Agent in gateway mode as a Docker service, published behind the reverse proxy on its own subdomain, with its compose service pinned to the isolating runtime that the Kata & gVisor role selects for the host. The API server is protected by a generated bearer key, and when the LiteLLM Gateway is part of the deployment the agent’s model endpoint is pointed at that gateway with a per-consumer virtual key. Agent state lives in a named volume that the Backup Docker Volumes service captures when it is enabled."
msgstr ""

# libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Home Assistant as a container on its own canonical domain behind the reverse proxy, with the configuration directory kept in a persistent volume. It renders a ``configuration.yaml`` that trusts the proxy through ``use_x_forwarded_for`` and the project-wide trusted-proxy CIDRs, and it attaches the hub to a shared overlay network. With Hermes Agent deployed alongside it, the role declares the hub as the MCP server of the deployment: an internal ``/api/mcp`` endpoint plus the long-lived access token that MCP clients present."
msgstr "Aquest rol col·loca Home Assistant com a contenidor en el seu propi domini convencional darrere de l' intermediari invers, amb el directori de configuració mantingut en un volum persistent. Representa un ``configuration.yaml`` que confia en l' intermediari a través de ``use_x_forwarded_for`` I els CIDRR de confiança de tot el projecte, i adjunta l'objectiu a una xarxa de recobriment compartida. Amb Hermes Agent Utilitzat al seu costat, el paper declara el centre com el servidor MCP del desplegament: una interna ``/api/mcp`` Punt d' acabament més la fitxa d'accés a llarg termini que presenta clients MCP."

