# libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Jenkins on Docker Compose. It builds a custom Jenkins image that pre-installs the ``oic-auth``, ``ldap``, ``role-strategy``, and ``configuration-as-code`` plugins, then mounts a JCasC YAML file that wires the security realm against Keycloak (variant 0, OIDC) or ``svc-db-openldap`` (variant 1, LDAP). The setup wizard is skipped via ``JAVA_OPTS=-Djenkins.install.runSetupWizard=false`` so the JCasC config takes over from first boot."
msgstr "Aquest rol col·loca Jenkins Si Docker Compose.. construeix un costum Jenkins imatge que pre-instal· la ``oic-auth``, ``ldap``, ``role-strategy``, i ``configuration-as-code`` Connectors, després munta un fitxer JCasC YAML en contra de la seguretat Keycloak (variant 0, OIDC) o ``svc-db-openldap`` (variant 1, LDAP)L' assistent de configuració s' omet via ``JAVA_OPTS=-Djenkins.install.runSetupWizard=false`` Així que la configuració de JCasC s'enlaira de la primera bota."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Jenkins on Docker Compose. It builds a custom Jenkins image that pre-installs the `oic-auth`, `ldap`, `role-strategy`, and `configuration-as-code` plugins, then mounts a JCasC YAML file that wires the security realm against Keycloak (variant 0, OIDC) or `svc-db-openldap` (variant 1, LDAP). The setup wizard is skipped via `JAVA_OPTS=-Djenkins.install.runSetupWizard=false` so the JCasC config takes over from first boot."
