# libretranslate
msgid "This role installs a systemd service that sends notifications via both [sys-ctl-alm-telegram](../sys-ctl-alm-telegram/README.md) and [sys-ctl-alm-email](../sys-ctl-alm-email/README.md) when any service fails."
msgstr "Aquest paper instal· la un servei que envia notificacions via ambdues [sys-ctl-alm-telegram](../sys-ctl-alm-telegram/README.md) i [sys-ctl-alm-email](../sys-ctl-alm-email/README.md) Quan falla qualsevol servei."

# libretranslate
