# libretranslate
msgid "This role owns the ``css`` service flag and declares ``web-svc-cdn`` as the upstream that serves the actual CSS bytes. Consumer roles gate CSS-dependent surfaces on ``'web-svc-css' in group_names`` via their own ``meta/services.yml``. The role’s canonical domain 301-redirects to the CDN’s canonical domain so health probes against the CSS hostname return a valid response."
msgstr "Aquest paper pertany ``css`` Bandera de servei i declaració ``web-svc-cdn`` a mesura que a dalt, serveix els bytes CSS actuals. Els rols dels consumidors porten les superfícies CSS-dependents ``'web-svc-css' in group_names`` A través dels seus propis ``meta/services.yml``. El paper del domini canònica 301-redirectes al domini convencional de la salut CDNbis, de manera que les songues de salut contra el nom de màquina CSS retornen una resposta vàlida."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role owns the `css` service flag and declares `web-svc-cdn` as the upstream that serves the actual CSS bytes. Consumer roles gate CSS-dependent surfaces on `'web-svc-css' in group_names` via their own `meta/services.yml`. The role's canonical domain 301-redirects to the CDN's canonical domain so health probes against the CSS hostname return a valid response."
