msgid "When `cli create role` scaffolds a new role, it prompts for `--clients N` and calls `cli contributing network address suggest --clients N --count 1` to fill in `meta/server.yml.networks.local.subnet` automatically. The contributor MAY override the suggestion interactively. See [port.md](port.md) for the matching ports flow."
msgstr "Quan `cli create role` Fa una nova funció `--clients N` i trucades `cli contributing network address suggest --clients N --count 1` per omplir `meta/server.yml.networks.local.subnet` automàticament. El col· laborador pot substituir el suggeriment interactivament. Veure [port.md](port.md) per al flux de ports coincidents."

# libretranslate
msgid "When `cli create role` scaffolds a new role, it prompts for required port categories per service entity and calls `cli contributing network ports suggest --scope <…> --category <…> --count 1` per slot to fill in the entity's `ports` map. The contributor MAY override either suggestion interactively. See [address.md](address.md) for the matching subnet flow."
msgstr "Quan `cli create role` Fa una nova funció, se sol· licitar les categories de port necessàries per entitat de servei i crida `cli contributing network ports suggest --scope <…> --category <…> --count 1` per lloc a omplir l' entitat `ports` mapa. El col·laborador pot substituir qualsevol suggeriment interactivament. Veure [address.md](address.md) per al flux de subxarxa coincident."

