msgid "When `svc-net-tor` is deployed, the node's `DOMAIN_PRIMARY` is the minted `.onion` address, so the whole stack (web vhosts, Keycloak SSO, LDAP, CA) resolves onion domains consistently. The Tor daemon runs as a host-network compose sidecar and maps one hidden service to the host OpenResty (`HiddenServicePort 80 -> 127.0.0.1:80`); per-app subdomains (`<app>.<node>.onion`) are routed by the `Host` header. TLS is off on the onion side (onion v3 already provides transport encryption + server authentication); apps still receive `X-Forwarded-Proto: https` because `.onion` is a browser Secure Context."
msgstr "Quan `svc-net-tor` s' usa, el node `DOMAIN_PRIMARY` és la mentada `.onion` adreça, així que tota la pila (Vihosts web, Keycloak SSO, LDAP, CA) Resol els dominis de l'ions de forma consistent. El dimoni Tor s' executa com a una màquina-network compondre un port lateral i mapes un servei ocult a la màquina OpenResty (`HiddenServicePort 80 -> 127.0.0.1:80`); per- apps sub dominis (`<app>.<node>.onion`) Estan preparats per la `Host` capçalera. TLS està apagat al costat de la ceba (onion v3 Ja proveeix autenticació a l' encriptatge del transport + servidor); aplicacions encara reben `X-Forwarded-Proto: https` perquè `.onion` És un context segur del navegador."

