# libretranslate
msgid "[ ] Credentials and secret URL components are absent from logs, generated non-secret configuration, API responses, task output, Playwright traces, and exception text. **Three of the six surfaces are held statically:** logs and task output by [test_mcp_secrets_are_masked.py](../../tests/lint/ansible/services/test_mcp_secrets_are_masked.py), which requires `no_log` or `mask_values` on any MCP task that both handles a secret and prints; Playwright traces by [test_mcp_secret_not_in_playwright.py](../../tests/lint/ansible/services/test_mcp_secret_not_in_playwright.py), which forbids a `playwright.env.j2` from rendering `mcp_credential`, a `credentials.mcp_*` secret or a `key_credential` URL component. Generated non-secret configuration needs a secret/non-secret classification of rendered files that does not exist yet; API responses and exception text are runtime observations for the deploy phase."
msgstr "[ ] Els components dels URL secrets i els components URL secrets no estan absents dels registres, generats per configuració no secreta, API Respostes, sortida de tasca, traces Playwright i text d' excepció. **Tres de les sis superfícies es mantenen estàticment:** Registres i sortida de tasca per [test_mcp_secrets_are_masked.py](../../tests/lint/ansible/services/test_mcp_secrets_are_masked.py), que requereix `no_log` o `mask_values` en qualsevol tasca MCP que gestiona tots dos un secret i imprimeix; Traces Playwright per [test_mcp_secret_not_in_playwright.py](../../tests/lint/ansible/services/test_mcp_secret_not_in_playwright.py), que prohibeix un `playwright.env.j2` per renderitzar `mcp_credential`, a `credentials.mcp_*` secret o a `key_credential` Component d' URL. La configuració no secreta necessita una classificació secreta/ no secreta dels fitxers que encara no existeixen; les respostes API i el text d' excepció s' executen en temps per a la fase d' desplegar."

