msgid "[ ] `SEMAPHORE_DB_DIALECT=postgres` plus `SEMAPHORE_DB_HOST/PORT/USER/PASS/SEMAPHORE_DB` are wired; when `services.postgres.shared=true` the role consumes the central `svc-db-postgres` (no per-role engine), else `sys-svc-rdbms` templates a per-role Postgres."
