msgstr "`UsersLookup` Dóna suport al `no-reply` L' usuari dic dict usat per derivar `from` i `password`. No hi ha entrades que facin un dic dict buit. La alternativa per a `from` llavors és `root@<inventory_hostname>.localdomain`."

# libretranslate
msgid "`Visual Studio Code <https://code.visualstudio.com/>`__ is a powerful source code editor with a wide plugin ecosystem, supporting development workflows across many languages and platforms. See also the `Arch Wiki - Development Tools <https://wiki.archlinux.org/title/Category:Development>`__ and general `Software Engineering <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Software_engineering>`__ on Wikipedia."
msgstr "`Visual Studio Code <https://code.visualstudio.com/>`__ és un potent editor de codi font amb un gran ecosistema del connector, que permet el desenvolupament fluxs de treball a través de molts idiomes i plataformes. Veure també la `Arch Wiki - Development Tools <https://wiki.archlinux.org/title/Category:Development>`__ i general `Software Engineering <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Software_engineering>`__ A la Viquipèdia."

