msgid "``modes`` in ``meta/services.yml`` states where a role RUNS; ``skip`` in ``meta/tests.yml`` deactivates TESTING a mode without touching that capability."
msgstr "``modes`` in ``meta/services.yml`` Els estats on un paper CORSCE; ``skip`` in ``meta/tests.yml`` Desactiva un mode sense tocar aquesta capacitat."

# libretranslate
msgid "``modes``: list of DEPLOYMENT_MODE values where this overlay applies"
msgstr "``modes``: llista de DEPLOYMENT_MODE Valors a on s' aplica aquest recobriment"

# libretranslate
