# libretranslate
msgid "ejabberd's only HTTP surface is `ejabberd_web_admin` on `/admin` (see [`templates/configuration.yml.j2`](./templates/configuration.yml.j2)). It authenticates a bare JID against LDAP over HTTP Basic, so there is no Keycloak redirect to follow and no in-app logout control to click; client authentication itself runs over ports 5222/5269 and stays outside the Playwright loop, as noted under Watch Points. `acl.admin` additionally lists only the administrator JID, so the web admin refuses every other account outright. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) therefore declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`; the `guest` persona and the baseline reachability assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "L'única superfície HTTP de ejabbed és `ejabberd_web_admin` Si `/admin` (Veure [`templates/configuration.yml.j2`](./templates/configuration.yml.j2))Es autenticarà un JID nu contra LDAP sobre el bàsic HTTP, per tant no hi ha Keycloak Redirigeix a seguir i no control de sortida per fer clic; l' autenticació del client s' executa sobre ports 5222/5269 i es queda fora del bucle Playwright, com va assenyalar sota Punts Watch. `acl.admin` Les llistes addicionals només informen JID, de manera que l'administrador web rebutja qualsevol altre compte fora de la dreta. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) Per tant, declara `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` i `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`; la `guest` La persona i les declaracions de la línia de partida s' executen incondicionalment."

